Skill Evaluator (browser)

This project re-implements, in TypeScript for the browser, the checks and scoring
model of NVIDIA SkillEvaluator (https://github.com/NVIDIA/SkillEvaluator),
Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Derived from NVIDIA SkillEvaluator:
  - Validation rules, severity levels, PII / unicode-smuggling / license patterns
  - The 4-dimension quality score (weights, deductions, A-F grade thresholds)
  - Deduplication thresholds and the evals/evals.json dataset format
  - The `calculator` and `text-analyzer` reference skills in src/examples/skills/
